Back in November 2023, we shared a [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/a=97/poll-blog-fortis-colosseum-x-perilous-moons?oldschool=1 poll blog] which included rewards for the upcoming Fortis Colosseum and Perilous Moons activities.

With the first batch of Varlamore content right around the corner, we’re reviewing some of those rewards. Although everything passed the poll, we feel that there’s still room for a few small improvements – accordingly, we want to present you with the opportunity to vote these improvements into the game.

